    {
      "id": "YL-001",
      "title": "元朗・村落晨光",
      "titleEn": "Yuen Long · Village Morning",
      "villageKey": "yuen-long",
      "topicKeys": ["community", "agriculture"],
      "eraKey": "1960s",
      "storyType": "farming",
      "mood": "wistful",
      "year": 1962,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "Boris Lau",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-001",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-25",
      "location": { "area": "元朗", "lat": 22.4445, "lng": 114.015, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": "assets/Demo Story.wav",
      "durationSec": 46.7,
      "durationSource": "measured",
      "cover": "assets/story-cover-village.png",
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 17.5,
          "text": "細個我住喺元朗一帶，周圍仲有好多農田，鄉村氣息好濃，大家出入多數都係踩單車。",
          "keywords": ["細個", "童年", "元朗", "農田", "田野", "鄉村", "鄉郊", "單車", "踩車", "出行", "交通"]
        },
        {
          "start": 17.5,
          "end": 33,
          "text": "大學畢業之後，我有時會同朋友返去附近散步，同佢哋介紹樹上雀鳥嘅叫聲，同草叢入面嘅蟲鳴。",
          "keywords": ["大學", "畢業", "朋友", "散步", "雀鳥", "雀仔", "叫聲", "蟲鳴", "昆蟲", "草叢", "樹木", "自然"]
        },
        {
          "start": 33,
          "end": 46.7,
          "text": "近年好多農田同空地都起咗密集樓宇，昔日寧靜自然嘅鄉郊環境慢慢消失，呢個係我印象最深嘅轉變。",
          "keywords": ["近年", "近排", "而家", "轉變", "變化", "發展", "起樓", "樓宇", "大廈", "密集", "消失", "環境"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "KT-002",
      "title": "錦田・圍村天后誕",
      "titleEn": "Kam Tin · Tin Hau Festival",
      "villageKey": "kam-tin",
      "topicKeys": ["festival", "clan"],
      "eraKey": "1950s",
      "storyType": "festival",
      "mood": "joyful",
      "year": 1955,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-002",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-26",
      "location": { "area": "錦田", "lat": 22.4405, "lng": 114.0635, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 50,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 16,
          "text": "我哋錦田圍村最重視天后誕，每年三月尾會搭戲棚、舞獅，仲有搶花炮，全村兄弟都會返嚟。",
          "keywords": ["錦田", "圍村", "天后誕", "天后", "戲棚", "做大戲", "舞獅", "花炮", "節慶", "神功戲"]
        },
        {
          "start": 16,
          "end": 34,
          "text": "細個跟阿媽去天后廟上香，之後全村食盆菜，幾十圍擺喺祠堂前面，豬肉同蠔豉最香。",
          "keywords": ["細個", "阿媽", "天后廟", "上香", "拜神", "盆菜", "祠堂", "豬肉", "蠔豉", "食"]
        },
        {
          "start": 34,
          "end": 50,
          "text": "近呢二十年儀式簡化咗好多，後生仔女肯返村幫手，已經算好難得，我哋最怕呢啲規矩失傳。",
          "keywords": ["近年", "而家", "儀式", "簡化", "後生", "年輕人", "返村", "幫手", "失傳", "傳統", "變化"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FL-003",
      "title": "粉嶺・聯和墟趁墟日",
      "titleEn": "Fanling · Luen Wo Market Day",
      "villageKey": "fanling",
      "topicKeys": ["market", "agriculture"],
      "eraKey": "1960s",
      "storyType": "market",
      "mood": "proud",
      "year": 1963,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-003",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-27",
      "location": { "area": "粉嶺", "lat": 22.4965, "lng": 114.1435, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 48,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 15,
          "text": "以前趁墟要天未光起身，擔住兩籮菜行去聯和墟，行到嗰陣個天啱啱光，街邊已經擺滿咗人。",
          "keywords": ["粉嶺", "聯和墟", "趁墟", "墟市", "天未光", "擔菜", "賣菜", "菜農", "街市", "行路"]
        },
        {
          "start": 15,
          "end": 32,
          "text": "墟市有菜檔、魚檔、布檔，仲有火車站，啲人搭火車去九龍返工，我哋就喺度賣完菜先返屋企。",
          "keywords": ["菜檔", "魚檔", "布檔", "火車", "火車站", "九龍", "返工", "賣菜", "買賣", "搭車"]
        },
        {
          "start": 32,
          "end": 48,
          "text": "而家聯和墟街市搬咗入冷氣大樓，乾淨係乾淨，但係以前嗰種人情味同叫賣聲，真係搵唔返。",
          "keywords": ["而家", "聯和墟", "街市", "冷氣", "大樓", "人情味", "叫賣", "變化", "以前", "對比"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SS-004",
      "title": "上水・石湖墟米舖",
      "titleEn": "Sheung Shui · Shek Wu Hui Rice Shop",
      "villageKey": "sheung-shui",
      "topicKeys": ["market", "border"],
      "eraKey": "1940s",
      "storyType": "market",
      "mood": "wistful",
      "year": 1948,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-004",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-28",
      "location": { "area": "上水", "lat": 22.5025, "lng": 114.1285, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 55,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 18,
          "text": "我阿爸喺石湖墟開米舖，啲米用麻包袋裝，一斗米賣幾個斗零，客人多數係附近鄉村嘅農民。",
          "keywords": ["上水", "石湖墟", "米舖", "米", "麻包袋", "斗零", "農民", "買米", "價錢", "生意"]
        },
        {
          "start": 18,
          "end": 37,
          "text": "石湖墟以前成日水浸，一到雨季就要把米搬上閣樓，水退之後成條街都係泥，要好幾日先清得完。",
          "keywords": ["水浸", "雨季", "搬米", "閣樓", "水退", "泥", "清理", "天災", "石湖墟", "街"]
        },
        {
          "start": 37,
          "end": 55,
          "text": "後來邊境愈來愈多人，火車運米落嚟，米舖生意好過以前，但係再過幾年，超級市場開張就唔同講法。",
          "keywords": ["邊境", "火車", "運米", "生意", "超級市場", "開張", "後來", "變化", "競爭", "米舖"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "STK-005",
      "title": "沙頭角・中英街邊境",
      "titleEn": "Sha Tau Kok · Chung Ying Street",
      "villageKey": "sha-tau-kok",
      "topicKeys": ["border", "migration"],
      "eraKey": "1970s",
      "storyType": "migration",
      "mood": "wistful",
      "year": 1972,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-005",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-29",
      "location": { "area": "沙頭角", "lat": 22.5475, "lng": 114.1495, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 47,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 15,
          "text": "沙頭角係禁區，入去要禁區紙，我哋細個跟大人去中英街，一條街一邊香港一邊深圳，好特別。",
          "keywords": ["沙頭角", "禁區", "禁區紙", "中英街", "香港", "深圳", "邊境", "邊界", "特別"]
        },
        {
          "start": 15,
          "end": 31,
          "text": "嗰陣去中英街主要係探親同買嘢，兩邊舖頭都做街坊生意，過關要排隊，但唔算好麻煩。",
          "keywords": ["探親", "買嘢", "舖頭", "街坊", "過關", "排隊", "中英街", "購物", "親戚"]
        },
        {
          "start": 31,
          "end": 47,
          "text": "後來邊境政策收緊，沙頭角墟愈來愈靜，年輕人都搬出去市區，剩返老人家守住間屋。",
          "keywords": ["後來", "邊境政策", "收緊", "沙頭角墟", "靜", "年輕人", "搬走", "市區", "老人家", "變化"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TP-006",
      "title": "大埔・林村河與荔枝園",
      "titleEn": "Tai Po · Lam Tsuen River",
      "villageKey": "tai-po",
      "topicKeys": ["ecology", "agriculture"],
      "eraKey": "1950s",
      "storyType": "farming",
      "mood": "joyful",
      "year": 1958,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-006",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-30",
      "location": { "area": "大埔", "lat": 22.4505, "lng": 114.1645, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 51,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 16,
          "text": "細個喺林村河邊大，夏天成班細路落河游水捉魚，河水好清，洗衫、洗菜都係用河水。",
          "keywords": ["大埔", "林村河", "細個", "游水", "捉魚", "河水", "洗衫", "洗菜", "童年", "夏天"]
        },
        {
          "start": 16,
          "end": 33,
          "text": "河兩邊以前係荔枝園同菜田，荔枝熟嘅時候，阿爸會擔去大埔墟賣，我哋就喺樹下執跌落地嘅。",
          "keywords": ["荔枝", "荔枝園", "菜田", "果園", "大埔墟", "賣", "擔", "生果", "務農", "收成"]
        },
        {
          "start": 33,
          "end": 51,
          "text": "後來河流整治，石屎化咗，水冇以前咁清；村屋愈起愈多，不過每年端午仲有人扒龍舟。",
          "keywords": ["後來", "河流整治", "石屎", "水質", "村屋", "起屋", "端午", "龍舟", "變化", "而家"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TSW-007",
      "title": "天水圍・魚塘變高樓",
      "titleEn": "Tin Shui Wai · Fish Ponds to High-rises",
      "villageKey": "tin-shui-wai",
      "topicKeys": ["migration", "community"],
      "eraKey": "1980s",
      "storyType": "migration",
      "mood": "heavy",
      "year": 1982,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-007",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-31",
      "location": { "area": "天水圍", "lat": 22.4595, "lng": 114.0045, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 53,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 17,
          "text": "以前天水圍全部係魚塘同基圍，我屋企養魚，朝早要落塘餵魚，收成季節就抽乾水捉魚去賣。",
          "keywords": ["天水圍", "魚塘", "基圍", "養魚", "餵魚", "捉魚", "收成", "抽水", "賣魚", "漁業"]
        },
        {
          "start": 17,
          "end": 35,
          "text": "八十年代政府收地發展新市鎮，我哋條村搬去第二度，魚塘填平起樓，好多鄰居都唔捨得。",
          "keywords": ["八十年代", "政府", "收地", "發展", "新市鎮", "搬村", "填塘", "起樓", "鄰居", "唔捨得"]
        },
        {
          "start": 35,
          "end": 53,
          "text": "而家天水圍高樓林立，住咗幾十萬人，交通方便咗，但係細個嗰種塘邊生活，只可以喺記憶度搵。",
          "keywords": ["而家", "天水圍", "高樓", "人口", "交通", "方便", "記憶", "變化", "以前", "生活"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LFS-008",
      "title": "流浮山・蠔田與鹹水歌",
      "titleEn": "Lau Fau Shan · Oyster Beds",
      "villageKey": "lau-fau-shan",
      "topicKeys": ["craft", "ecology"],
      "eraKey": "1960s",
      "storyType": "farming",
      "mood": "proud",
      "year": 1963,
      "languageKey": "yue",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（義工整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-008",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-01",
      "location": { "area": "流浮山", "lat": 22.4685, "lng": 113.9835, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 49,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 16,
          "text": "流浮山最有名係蠔，我哋叫蠔田，潮退嘅時候落去撬蠔，潮水一漲就要即刻返上岸，好講究時間。",
          "keywords": ["流浮山", "蠔", "蠔田", "養蠔", "撬蠔", "潮退", "潮水", "潮汐", "上岸", "海"]
        },
        {
          "start": 16,
          "end": 32,
          "text": "以前落蠔田會唱鹹水歌，一人一句咁對唱，講天氣、講收成，而家識唱嘅人已經好少。",
          "keywords": ["鹹水歌", "唱歌", "對唱", "收成", "天氣", "漁民", "歌謠", "傳統", "而家", "失傳"]
        },
        {
          "start": 32,
          "end": 49,
          "text": "後來后海灣水質變差，蠔業慢慢式微，好多人轉做酒家生意，不過每年仲有蠔節，好熱鬧。",
          "keywords": ["后海灣", "水質", "蠔業", "式微", "酒家", "生意", "蠔節", "熱鬧", "轉行", "變化"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "STN-009",
      "title": "赤柱・海邊的市集",
      "titleEn": "Stanley · Market by the Sea",
      "villageKey": "stanley",
      "topicKeys": ["market", "community"],
      "eraKey": "1960s",
      "storyType": "market",
      "mood": "reflective",
      "year": 1965,
      "languageKey": "en",
      "teller": "Role-played demo (team-written)",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-009",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-09",
      "location": { "area": "赤柱", "lat": 22.2185, "lng": 114.213, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 50,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 16,
          "text": "I grew up in Stanley in the 1960s, when the bay was still working water: fishing boats, the ferry pier, and a market that smelled of dried fish and incense.",
          "keywords": ["Stanley", "1960s", "bay", "fishing boats", "ferry pier", "market", "dried fish", "incense"]
        },
        {
          "start": 16,
          "end": 34,
          "text": "My mother sold vegetables there. She knew every family by name; if someone could not pay that day, she wrote it in a notebook and never mentioned it again.",
          "keywords": ["mother", "vegetables", "market", "family", "notebook", "credit", "neighbours", "trust"]
        },
        {
          "start": 34,
          "end": 50,
          "text": "The buildings have changed, but the sea is the same. When I walk along the promenade, I still hear the market waking up before dawn.",
          "keywords": ["buildings", "change", "sea", "promenade", "dawn", "memory", "Stanley", "harbour"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "KLC-010",
      "title": "九龍城・啟德機場下的日子",
      "titleEn": "Kowloon City · Under the Kai Tak Flight Path",
      "villageKey": "kowloon-city",
      "topicKeys": ["migration", "community"],
      "eraKey": "1970s",
      "storyType": "migration",
      "mood": "wistful",
      "year": 1975,
      "languageKey": "zh",
      "teller": "角色扮演示範（團隊整理）",
      "rolePlayed": true,
      "authorized": true,
      "consentRef": "CONSENT-DEMO-010",
      "scope": "community",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-09",
      "location": { "area": "九龍城", "lat": 22.33, "lng": 114.19, "radiusM": 800 },
      "audio": null,
      "durationSec": 52,
      "durationSource": "transcript",
      "cover": null,
      "segments": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 17,
          "text": "我是一九七五年跟着父母从潮州来香港的，第一间屋就在九龙城。飞机低低地飞过头顶，窗框会响，讲话要停一下。",
          "keywords": ["一九七五年", "潮州", "香港", "九龙城", "飞机", "启德", "窗框", "移民"]
        },
        {
          "start": 17,
          "end": 35,
          "text": "妈妈在街市卖粿条，我在旁边写功课。街坊来自很多地方，潮州话、福建话、广东话混在一起，谁也听得懂谁。",
          "keywords": ["妈妈", "街市", "粿条", "功课", "街坊", "潮州话", "福建话", "广东话"]
        },
        {
